-1|0@csgobetting^1440255772#cubtxe3:JinjaHD$:Alright - I feel bad for all of these dumb replies so I'll tell you what to buy. + Deposit the $20 to OPSkins (unless its $20 steam) - Buy approx 15 CSGO Capsule Keys (ORIGINAL ONLY! The community ones **ARE NOT** bettable) * Then buy as many original CSGO Case Keys as you have left (Remember, original only!) + You should be left with ~ 15 Capsule keys (~$1 Value) and ~ 2 CSGO Case Keys (~$2.60 Value) Now, start betting with the capsule keys. Only bet 1 key at a time. Make sure you bet smart too. Don't make any super risky bets unless you have a profit and even at that don't EVER go all in. I'd suggest using the 2 actual keys to subscribe to a betting service if you'd like. I personally make free [YouTube video's](http://youtube.com/c/Jinja) daily suggesting bets or you could pay to subscribe to a service. I've seen very good things from [this](http://twitter.com/maintain) guy. Good luck.
